  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Ever since i started playing the game with Comfort Turning off a big issue I've had is how slow turning in VRChat is. For someone with an Oculus and no 360° tracking, having the option to increase the turning speed would be very useful and less frustrating than having to stare in front of you while you're waiting for your character to spin to the person behind you.\n\nDifficulties start to occur especially when the game starts to lag (which as we know is not on rare occasions), and turning with the joysticks becomes almost impossible.\n\nBeing able to turn faster would also help reduce motion sickness (as I have observed in games like SkyrimVR), without having to use the snap turning mode that ruins immersion for the player.",
